  <entry>
    <title>零成本个人主页搭建详细流程</title>
    <link href="/2026/09/20/Personal_Homepage/"/>
    <url>/2026/09/20/Personal_Homepage/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="零成本个人主页搭建详细流程"><a href="#零成本个人主页搭建详细流程" class="headerlink" title="零成本个人主页搭建详细流程"></a>零成本个人主页搭建详细流程</h1><p>这篇文章完整记录我在 Windows 电脑上使用 Hexo 搭建个人主页，并通过 GitHub Actions 自动部署到 GitHub Pages 的流程。当前浏览的这个就是我的个人主页了。内容包含环境安装、源码仓库、部署仓库、Fluid 主题、自动部署、文章发布和常见问题。(<strong>注：以下内容中<code>YWXK2016</code>为我个人的github账号，在搭建过程中需要替换为自己的github账号</strong>)</p><h2 id="一、最终架构"><a href="#一、最终架构" class="headerlink" title="一、最终架构"></a>一、最终架构</h2><p>整个系统分为两个 GitHub 仓库：</p><ol><li><p><code>blog-source</code><br>私有仓库，保存 Hexo 源码、文章、主题配置和 GitHub Actions 工作流。</p></li><li><p><code>YWXK2016.github.io</code><br>公共仓库，保存 Hexo 构建后的静态文件，由 GitHub Pages 对外提供访问。</p></li></ol><p>博客文章发布流程如下：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">本地电脑使用Markdown编写文章(我用的Typora)<br>    ↓<br>git push 到 blog-source<br>    ↓<br>GitHub Actions 自动执行 hexo clean 和 hexo generate<br>    ↓<br>public 目录发布到 YWXK2016.github.io<br>    ↓<br>访问 https://ywxk2016.github.io/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这种方式不会把 Hexo 源码和网页构建结果混在一起，后续维护更加清晰。</p><h2 id="二、Windows-环境准备"><a href="#二、Windows-环境准备" class="headerlink" title="二、Windows 环境准备"></a>二、Windows 环境准备</h2><h3 id="1-安装-Node-js"><a href="#1-安装-Node-js" class="headerlink" title="1. 安装 Node.js"></a>1. 安装 Node.js</h3><p>打开 Node.js 官网并安装 LTS 版本：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">https://nodejs.org/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装完成后打开 cmd，检查版本：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">node <span class="hljs-literal">-v</span><br>npm <span class="hljs-literal">-v</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/1.webp"></p><p>建议使用 Node.js 20 或更高版本。GitHub Actions 当前使用 Node.js 24。</p><h3 id="2-安装-Git"><a href="#2-安装-Git" class="headerlink" title="2. 安装 Git"></a>2. 安装 Git</h3><p>安装 Git for Windows：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">https://git-scm.com/download/win<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检查安装结果：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">git <span class="hljs-literal">--version</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/2.webp"></p><p>配置 Git 用户名和邮箱：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">git config <span class="hljs-literal">--global</span> user.name <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;你的 GitHub 用户名&#x27;</span><br>git config <span class="hljs-literal">--global</span> user.email <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;你的邮箱&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、创建-Hexo-博客"><a href="#三、创建-Hexo-博客" class="headerlink" title="三、创建 Hexo 博客"></a>三、创建 Hexo 博客</h2><h3 id="1-安装-Hexo-CLI"><a href="#1-安装-Hexo-CLI" class="headerlink" title="1. 安装 Hexo CLI"></a>1. 安装 Hexo CLI</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">npm install <span class="hljs-literal">-g</span> hexo<span class="hljs-literal">-cli</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检查版本：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">hexo version<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/3.webp"></p><h3 id="2-初始化博客"><a href="#2-初始化博客" class="headerlink" title="2. 初始化博客"></a>2. 初始化博客</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> C:\Users\ywxk<br>hexo init blog<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> blog<br>npm install<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-本地启动"><a href="#3-本地启动" class="headerlink" title="3. 本地启动"></a>3. 本地启动</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">hexo server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>浏览器访问：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://localhost:4000/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/4.webp"></p><p>如果端口被占用：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">hexo server <span class="hljs-literal">--port</span> <span class="hljs-number">4001</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="四、安装并配置-Fluid-主题"><a href="#四、安装并配置-Fluid-主题" class="headerlink" title="四、安装并配置 Fluid 主题"></a>四、安装并配置 Fluid 主题</h2><p>通过 npm 安装 Fluid：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">npm install hexo<span class="hljs-literal">-theme-fluid</span> <span class="hljs-literal">--save</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开根目录的 <code>_config.yml</code>，设置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">theme:</span> <span class="hljs-string">fluid</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">url:</span> <span class="hljs-string">https://ywxk2016.github.io/</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">language:</span> <span class="hljs-string">zh-CN</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>不要长期直接修改：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">node_modules/hexo-theme-fluid/_config.yml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推荐在博客根目录创建：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">_config.fluid.yml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>主题重新安装或升级时，根目录配置文件不会被覆盖。</p><p>常用配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">navbar:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">blog_title:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;仰望星空&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">post:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">banner_img:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/img/banners/post.webp</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">banner_img_height:</span> <span class="hljs-number">80</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">meta:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">views:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">source:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;busuanzi&#x27;</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">format:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;阅读 &#123;&#125; 次&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">footer:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">statistics:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">source:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;busuanzi&#x27;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">pv_format:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;总阅读量 &#123;&#125; 次&#x27;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">uv_format:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;访问人数 &#123;&#125; 人&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>图片统一放在：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/img/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>网页中通过根路径引用：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">/img/banners/home.webp<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>不要直接修改 <code>public</code>，因为每次执行 <code>hexo clean</code> 都会删除它。</p><h2 id="五、创建-GitHub-仓库"><a href="#五、创建-GitHub-仓库" class="headerlink" title="五、创建 GitHub 仓库"></a>五、创建 GitHub 仓库</h2><h3 id="1-创建个人主页仓库"><a href="#1-创建个人主页仓库" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建个人主页仓库"></a>1. 创建个人主页仓库</h3><p>在 GitHub 新建仓库：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">YWXK2016.github.io<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>仓库名称必须符合：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">用户名.github.io<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个仓库用于保存 GitHub Pages 构建结果。在 <code>Settings -&gt; Pages</code> 中确认发布分支为：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">main<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/5.webp"></p><h3 id="2-创建源码仓库"><a href="#2-创建源码仓库" class="headerlink" title="2. 创建源码仓库"></a>2. 创建源码仓库</h3><p>再创建一个仓库用于保存 Hexo 源码：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">blog-source<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本地绑定源码仓库：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">git init<br>git remote add origin git@github.com:YWXK2016/blog<span class="hljs-literal">-source</span>.git<br>git add .<br>git commit <span class="hljs-literal">-m</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;init hexo blog&#x27;</span><br>git branch <span class="hljs-literal">-M</span> main<br>git push <span class="hljs-literal">-u</span> origin main<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="六、配置部署密钥"><a href="#六、配置部署密钥" class="headerlink" title="六、配置部署密钥"></a>六、配置部署密钥</h2><p>GitHub Actions 需要把构建结果推送到 <code>YWXK2016.github.io</code>，因此需要一对 SSH 密钥。</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">ssh<span class="hljs-literal">-keygen</span> <span class="hljs-literal">-t</span> ed25519 <span class="hljs-literal">-C</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;github-actions-deploy&#x27;</span> <span class="hljs-operator">-f</span> C:\Users\ywxk\.ssh\blog<span class="hljs-literal">-deploy-key</span>\id_ed25519 <span class="hljs-literal">-N</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>生成：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">C:\Users\ywxk\.ssh\blog-deploy-key\id_ed25519<br>C:\Users\ywxk\.ssh\blog-deploy-key\id_ed25519.pub<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/6.webp"></p><h3 id="1-添加公钥"><a href="#1-添加公钥" class="headerlink" title="1. 添加公钥"></a>1. 添加公钥</h3><p>打开 <code>YWXK2016.github.io</code> 仓库：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Settings -&gt; Deploy keys -&gt; Add deploy key<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>粘贴 <code>id_ed25519.pub</code> 的内容，并勾选：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Allow write access<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/7.webp"></p><h3 id="2-添加私钥-Secret"><a href="#2-添加私钥-Secret" class="headerlink" title="2. 添加私钥 Secret"></a>2. 添加私钥 Secret</h3><p>打开源码仓库 <code>blog-source</code>：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Settings -&gt; Secrets and variables -&gt; Actions -&gt; New repository secret<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>创建：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">Name: DEPLOY_KEY<br>Value: id_ed25519 私钥文件的完整内容<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>查看私钥：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell"><span class="hljs-built_in">Get-Content</span> C:\Users\ywxk\.ssh\blog<span class="hljs-literal">-deploy-key</span>\id_ed25519 <span class="hljs-literal">-Raw</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>私钥只能放在 GitHub Secret 中，不能提交到仓库。</p><p><img src="/img/post/Personal_Homepage/8.webp"></p><h2 id="七、配置-GitHub-Actions-自动部署"><a href="#七、配置-GitHub-Actions-自动部署" class="headerlink" title="七、配置 GitHub Actions 自动部署"></a>七、配置 GitHub Actions 自动部署</h2><p>在源码仓库创建，或者本地创建后通过git提交到仓库：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">.github/workflows/deploy.yml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>完整配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Deploy</span> <span class="hljs-string">Hexo</span> <span class="hljs-string">Blog</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">on:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">push:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">branches:</span> [<span class="hljs-string">main</span>]<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">schedule:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">cron:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;17 2 * * *&#x27;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">workflow_dispatch:</span><br><br><span class="hljs-attr">jobs:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">build-and-deploy:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">runs-on:</span> <span class="hljs-string">ubuntu-latest</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">permissions:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-attr">contents:</span> <span class="hljs-string">write</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">steps:</span><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">uses:</span> <span class="hljs-string">actions/checkout@v4</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">with:</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">fetch-depth:</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">uses:</span> <span class="hljs-string">actions/setup-node@v4</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">with:</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">node-version:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;20&#x27;</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">cache:</span> <span class="hljs-string">npm</span><br><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Install</span> <span class="hljs-string">Dependencies</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">run:</span> <span class="hljs-string">|</span><br><span class="hljs-string">          npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br><span class="hljs-string">          npm install</span><br><span class="hljs-string"></span><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Generate</span> <span class="hljs-string">GitHub</span> <span class="hljs-string">Contributions</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">run:</span> <span class="hljs-string">npm</span> <span class="hljs-string">run</span> <span class="hljs-string">contributions</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">env:</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">CONTRIBUTIONS_TOKEN:</span> <span class="hljs-string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="hljs-string">secrets.CONTRIBUTIONS_TOKEN</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#125;&#125;</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">GITHUB_USERNAME:</span> <span class="hljs-string">YWXK2016</span><br><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Build</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">run:</span> <span class="hljs-string">|</span><br><span class="hljs-string">          hexo clean</span><br><span class="hljs-string">          hexo generate</span><br><span class="hljs-string"></span><br>      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-attr">name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Deploy</span> <span class="hljs-string">to</span> <span class="hljs-string">GitHub</span> <span class="hljs-string">Pages</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">uses:</span> <span class="hljs-string">peaceiris/actions-gh-pages@v3</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">with:</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">external_repository:</span> <span class="hljs-string">YWXK2016/YWXK2016.github.io</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">publish_branch:</span> <span class="hljs-string">main</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">publish_dir:</span> <span class="hljs-string">./public</span><br>          <span class="hljs-attr">deploy_key:</span> <span class="hljs-string">$&#123;&#123;</span> <span class="hljs-string">secrets.DEPLOY_KEY</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#125;&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>工作流会依次安装依赖、获取贡献数据、构建 Hexo，并把 <code>public</code> 目录推送到个人主页仓库。</p><h2 id="八、发布新文章"><a href="#八、发布新文章" class="headerlink" title="八、发布新文章"></a>八、发布新文章</h2><h3 id="1-创建文章"><a href="#1-创建文章" class="headerlink" title="1. 创建文章"></a>1. 创建文章</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">npx hexo new post <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;文章标题&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>也可以直接创建：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/_posts/文章标题.md<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推荐文章 Front Matter：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">title:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;文章标题&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">date:</span> <span class="hljs-number">2026-09-20 18:00:00</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">description:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;文章摘要。&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">keywords:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">Hexo</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">GitHub</span> <span class="hljs-string">Pages</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">tags:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">Hexo</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">GitHub</span> <span class="hljs-string">Pages</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">categories:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">博客搭建</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">index_img:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/img/covers/example.webp</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">---</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>字段说明：</p><ul><li><code>title</code>：文章标题。</li><li><code>date</code>：发布时间。</li><li><code>description</code>：文章摘要。</li><li><code>keywords</code>：页面关键词。</li><li><code>tags</code>：文章标签。</li><li><code>categories</code>：文章分类。</li><li><code>index_img</code>：首页文章封面。</li></ul><h3 id="2-添加图片"><a href="#2-添加图片" class="headerlink" title="2. 添加图片"></a>2. 添加图片</h3><p>图片建议放在：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/img/posts/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Markdown 引用：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs markdown">![<span class="hljs-string">图片说明</span>](<span class="hljs-link">/img/posts/example.webp</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>首页封面：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">index_img:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/img/posts/example.webp</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>文章详情页顶部大图：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">banner_img:</span> <span class="hljs-string">/img/banners/post.webp</span><br><span class="hljs-attr">banner_img_height:</span> <span class="hljs-number">80</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-本地预览"><a href="#3-本地预览" class="headerlink" title="3. 本地预览"></a>3. 本地预览</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">hexo clean<br>hexo generate<br>hexo server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>访问：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://localhost:4000/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检查首页卡片、文章正文、分类、标签、阅读量、分享按钮、页脚统计和移动端布局。</p><h3 id="4-提交并自动部署"><a href="#4-提交并自动部署" class="headerlink" title="4. 提交并自动部署"></a>4. 提交并自动部署</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">git add .<br>git commit <span class="hljs-literal">-m</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;post: 新增文章&#x27;</span><br>git push origin main<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>推送后，GitHub Actions 会自动构建和部署。Actions 成功后访问：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">https://ywxk2016.github.io/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="九、网站验证文件"><a href="#九、网站验证文件" class="headerlink" title="九、网站验证文件"></a>九、网站验证文件</h2><p>微信或其他平台要求在网站根目录添加验证文件时，不要把文件放在 <code>public</code>，因为 <code>hexo clean</code> 会删除它。</p><p>正确位置：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/验证文件.txt<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>例如：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/MP_verify_abcdef123456.txt<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>提交后，构建会自动复制到网站根目录，访问地址为：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">https://ywxk2016.github.io/MP_verify_abcdef123456.txt<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="十、日常维护"><a href="#十、日常维护" class="headerlink" title="十、日常维护"></a>十、日常维护</h2><p>新增文章：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">npx hexo new post <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;新的文章标题&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>发布：</p><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">git add .<br>git commit <span class="hljs-literal">-m</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;post: 新增文章&#x27;</span><br>git push origin main<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后等待 GitHub Actions 部署完成。</p><h2 id="十一、常见问题"><a href="#十一、常见问题" class="headerlink" title="十一、常见问题"></a>十一、常见问题</h2><h3 id="1-本地预览没有更新"><a href="#1-本地预览没有更新" class="headerlink" title="1. 本地预览没有更新"></a>1. 本地预览没有更新</h3><figure class="highlight powershell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs powershell">hexo clean<br>hexo server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改 <code>_config.yml</code> 或 <code>_config.fluid.yml</code> 后通常需要重启服务。</p><h3 id="2-部署成功但页面仍是旧内容"><a href="#2-部署成功但页面仍是旧内容" class="headerlink" title="2. 部署成功但页面仍是旧内容"></a>2. 部署成功但页面仍是旧内容</h3><p>浏览器可能使用了缓存。按 <code>Ctrl + F5</code> 强制刷新。</p><h3 id="3-Actions-部署失败"><a href="#3-Actions-部署失败" class="headerlink" title="3. Actions 部署失败"></a>3. Actions 部署失败</h3><p>检查：</p><ul><li><code>DEPLOY_KEY</code> 是否存在。</li><li>公钥是否添加到 <code>YWXK2016.github.io</code> 的 Deploy keys。</li><li>Deploy key 是否勾选 <code>Allow write access</code>。</li><li><code>external_repository</code> 是否正确。</li><li><code>publish_branch</code> 是否为 <code>main</code>。</li></ul><h3 id="4-图片部署后不显示"><a href="#4-图片部署后不显示" class="headerlink" title="4. 图片部署后不显示"></a>4. 图片部署后不显示</h3><p>检查图片是否位于 <code>source</code>、文件名大小写是否一致、配置扩展名是否和真实文件一致，以及是否误放在 <code>public</code>。</p><h3 id="5-私有贡献没有显示"><a href="#5-私有贡献没有显示" class="headerlink" title="5. 私有贡献没有显示"></a>5. 私有贡献没有显示</h3><p>需要开启 GitHub 私有贡献显示，并在 <code>blog-source</code> 中配置 <code>CONTRIBUTIONS_TOKEN</code>。</p><h2 id="十二、总结"><a href="#十二、总结" class="headerlink" title="十二、总结"></a>十二、总结</h2><p>需要长期记住三个位置：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">source/_posts/<br>source/img/<br>.github/workflows/deploy.yml<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>日常流程：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">写文章 -&gt; 本地预览 -&gt; git push -&gt; 等待 Actions -&gt; 线上访问<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>至此，Hexo、Fluid、GitHub Pages 和 GitHub Actions 的完整搭建与发布流程就串联起来了。</p>]]></content>
    
    
